  "details": "Hello. This is a bug report.\n(Using Google translation)\n\n1) Prepare an account with Friend 0.\n2) Log in to VRChat with the account you normally use.\n3) Open \"Social\" and let the online friends read once.\n4) While running VRChat, \"Logout\" from \"System\".\n5) Log in again with account of Friend 0.\n6) When \"Social\" is displayed, the user displayed in (3) is displayed as a friend on the list.\n7) It will be possible to join a friend-only instance of each user with a new account etc.\n\nthat's all.",
